   - This allows Then steps to reference `{{ .step_results.step1 }}`

3. **Rebuild scratchpad on goto re-invocation** (ritual.go:920-923)
   - Always build scratchpad, even when session exists
   - The session provides conversation continuity, but scratchpad must reflect current state
